# The committed icon is compared byte-for-byte against the geometry in
# src/mark.rs (`mark::tests::the_committed_svg_matches_the_geometry`), so it has
# to be checked out exactly as it was committed. Without this, a Windows
# checkout with `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites its line endings and the test
# fails on a file nobody touched.
assets/icon.svg text eol=lf
